        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4900BM, Rustic Pipe Handles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIndustrial decor is much sought after and the Pipe Door Handle exudes a beauty in its rustic design that makes it the perfect fit for shabby chic lovers everywhere. This door pull is made to look like a pipe, but with an attention to style and form. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and antique english finishes. Choose from a 12 inch or an 18 inch length. Made by RK International, the Pipe Pull is packaged and sold as a pair (2 pulls) with back to back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Also Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/pipe-door-handle-rk-international-ph-4880\"><b>Pipe Through Bolt Mounted Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-4900BM</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 13-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-4901BM</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 19-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i> Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
